---
/**
 * The only place the site asks for work.
 *
 * One line, once per page, below the content rather than inside a result. The
 * tools are the pitch; repeating a call to action after every finding makes the
 * findings read like bait.
 */
---

<div class="consult">
  <div class="md-wrap">
    <p>
      Every fix on this site is yours to implement. If you would rather someone did it, <a href="/practice">I take this work directly</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .consult {
    border-top: var(--md-hairline) solid var(--md-line);
    padding-block: var(--md-space-6);
  }

  .consult p {
    font-size: var(--md-text-sm);
    color: var(--md-faint);
  }

  .consult a {
    color: var(--md-red);
    border-bottom: var(--md-hairline) solid currentColor;
  }
</style>
